":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（1）滑块从 D 到 E 做斜抛运动，E 点为最高点，分解"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"竖直方向"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}=v_{0}\\sin\\theta=4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，水平方向"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}=v_{0}\\cos\\theta=3m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"，（1分）\n竖直位移为 y，则"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y}^{2}=2gy"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得 y=0.8m（1 分）\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"h=y+0.4m=1.2m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2) 滑块以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}=3\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"滑上传送带, 假设能被加速到"},{"type":"math","value":"v=5\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":", 则"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{v^{2}-v_{x}^{2}}{2\\mu_{1}g}=1.6\\mathrm{m}<l_{1}=4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"成立 (1分) 故滑块离开 F 点的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}=5\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1分)\n从"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"到"},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"由动能定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"-mgR - \\mu_2mgl_2 = 0 - \\frac{1}{2} mv_F^2"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2} = 0.3"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）由分析可知，物块从 P 返回后向左进入传送带，又被传送带原速率带回，设物块从 P 返回后，在 FG 之间滑行的总路程为 s，则"},{"type":"math","value":"mgR - \\mu_{2}mgs = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"s = \\frac{8}{3}m"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分），所以，滑块停止时离 G 点"},{"type":"math","value":"x = 2l_{2} - s = \\frac{1}{3}m"},{"type":"text","value":"处（1 分）\n（4）设传送带速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，滑块恰能到 Q 点，在 Q 点满足"},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin\\alpha = m\\frac{v_{Q}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{Q} = \\sqrt{4.8}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"从 F 到 Q 由动能定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\mu_{2}mgl_{2}-mgR(1+\\sin\\alpha)=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{Q}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{1}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=\\sqrt{39.4}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n传送带速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，滑块撞挡板后恰能重回P点，动能定理"},{"type":"math","value":"-3\\mu_{2}mgl_{2}-mgR=0-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{2}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=\\sqrt{43}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n若滑块被传送带一直加速，则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}mgl_{1}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{m}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}mv_{x}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{m}=7m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n所以，传送带可调节的速度范围为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sqrt{39.4}m/s\\leq v\\leq\\sqrt{43}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（结论错误扣1分【即上面答案分少得1分】）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412-q19","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412","source_question_id":"zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412-q19","number":"19","order":19,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"3017c9807082b66472df462ac2bd2608e636d87b00ad04772d401d6f2b1cff33","body":[{"type":"text","value":"19.（11分）某兴趣小组设计了一个磁悬浮列车的驱动模型，简化原理如图甲所示，Oxy平面（纸面）内有宽为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 关于 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴对称的磁场区域，磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，变化规律如图乙所示。长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"d"},{"type":"text","value":" ，宽为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 的矩形金属线框MM'N'N放置在图中所示位置，其中MN边与y轴重合，MM'、NN'边分别与磁场的上下边界重合。当磁场以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴向左匀速运动时，会驱动线框运动，线框受到的阻力大小恒为 "},{"type":"math","value":"f"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知线框的质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，总电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）求磁场刚开始运动时，通过线框的感应电流的大小和方向；  \n（2）求线框稳定运动时的速度大小 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" （3）某时刻磁场停止运动，此后线框运动 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" 时间后停止，求 "},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":" 时间内线框运动的距离 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（4）在磁悬浮列车的实际模型中，磁感应强度的大小是随时间和空间同时变化的，即 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = B_{0}\\cos \\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{T} t + \\frac{\\pi}{d} x\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":" ，若将线框固定不动，求在 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{T}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时间内线框产生的热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0fb50b801569d9fded04cdbe88ffccc9341c71a4b7ce302c8cfb3c094a1de76c.png","width":494,"height":289,"width_mm":57.96,"row_group":"zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7bd4a09cc4dc466256608ac58e7706f165ccd4285c36580c8f284d50f85c692d.png","width":367,"height":322,"width_mm":43.05,"row_group":"zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412-q19-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图乙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"19.（1）由右手定则得，感应电流沿顺时针方向"},{"type":"math","value":"E=2B_{0}Lv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":";"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{E}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），解得"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{2B_{0}Lv_{0}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2) 线框稳定运动后, 电流大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac{2B_0L(v_0 - v_1)}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分), 安培力大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"F = 2B_0IL"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分) 由受力平衡可知"},{"type":"math","value":"F = f"},{"type":"text","value":", 解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_1 = v_0 - \\frac{fR}{4B_0^2L^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)\n（3）由动量定理可得"},{"type":"math","value":"-\\Sigma \\left(f + \\frac{4B_0^2L^2v}{R}\\right)\\Delta t = 0 - mv_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，即"},{"type":"math","value":"-ft - \\frac{4B_0^2L^2}{R}\\Sigma v\\Delta t = 0 - mv_1"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x = \\Sigma v\\Delta t = \\frac{R}{4B_0^2L^2}\\left[m\\left(v_0 - \\frac{fR}{4B_0^2L^2}\\right) - ft\\right]"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（4）该磁场可等效为磁感应强度为"},{"type":"math","value":"B=B_{0}\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{d}x\\right)"},{"type":"text","value":"，且以速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v'=\\frac{2d}{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"运动的磁场（1分），在线框中产生正弦式交流电，电动势的最大值为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{m}=2B_{0}Lv'"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），故产生的热量为"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{E_{m}}{\\sqrt{2}}\\right)^{2}}{R}\\frac{T}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），解得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q=\\frac{4B_{0}^{2}L^{2}d^{2}}{RT}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-shoukao--zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412-q20","paper_id":"zj-25-shoukao--zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412","source_question_id":"zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412-q20","number":"20","order":20,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e981f88a00be64c8eaf5598adfe368f7a125cdf570b315295449b2e98427ab32","body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（11分）如图甲所示， "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 点是一个粒子源，能在上半平面内沿着各个方向均匀、持续地发射电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":" ，质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，速度大小恒定的电子。上半平面内的半圆形区域内，存在垂直纸面向里，磁感应强度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场。半圆形区域半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，圆弧边缘是由金属材料制成的极板，当电子打到极板上会瞬间被极板吸收，并与外电路形成回路，因此可以测出回路中的电流大小。则\n（1）电子速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为多大时，有三分之二的电子能打到极板；\n（2）电子以第（1）问中的 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 发射，测得外电路的电流强度大小为I，试求半圆弧极板在半径方向受到的作用力大小之和；\n（3）如图乙所示，若磁场形状改为半圆形环状磁场区域，圆环内半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" ，外半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" 。磁场方向和大小不变，粒子源仍在圆心 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 。若电子的发射速度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" ，每秒钟发射 "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 个，则电子速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":" 与外电路的电流强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":" 的关系式。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4bb98e746176a540df3e716812d7a32f7a1b2d753f78033ff7af48fc8ee807bb.png","width":362,"height":223,"width_mm":42.42,"row_group":"zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d741998c1acdc28e196a6f98d6df1498def5d63cc17dd3095214f9a3e005cf3c.png","width":362,"height":228,"width_mm":42.42,"row_group":"zhejiang-ningbo-zhenhai-zhongxue-2412-q20-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图乙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"20.（1）根据题意，由左手定则可知，若有三分之二的电子能打到极板，表明右侧60度范围内发射的电子无法打到极板，如图所示\n有几何关系得"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{R}{\\sqrt{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），由牛顿第二定律有"},{"type":"math","value":"ev_{0}B=m\\frac{v_{0}^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\frac{BeR}{\\sqrt{3}m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/db212ae10449906adb1c8c7f2bac47774524d38114bf72464014d3a163aa0cef.png","width":215,"height":160,"width_mm":27.1},{"type":"text","value":"(2) 若电子以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"发射, 任意一电子打到极板时, 与半径方向的夹角均为"},{"type":"math","value":"60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":", 如图所示因此电子由于吸收引起的动量改变均相同"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta P = mv_{0} \\cos 60^{\\circ} = \\frac{\\sqrt{3} B e R}{6}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分) 又因为外电路的电流强度大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":", 则"},{"type":"math","value":"t"},{"type":"text","value":"时间打到极板上的电子数目为"},{"type":"math","value":"N = \\frac{It}{e}"},{"type":"text","value":"(1 分)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f99ccf63b84e3ba2b36055ff042dd01751780be4267ed99a0b15d86e5be23253.png","width":218,"height":181,"width_mm":27.5},{"type":"text","value":"设半圆弧极板在半径方向受到的作用力大小之和为F，由动量定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"Ft=N\\cdot\\Delta p"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"F=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}BRI}{6}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（3）根据题意，粒子以速度v进入，运动轨迹如图所示\n设粒子运动的轨迹半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由几何关系得"},{"type":"math","value":"(R-R_{1})^{2}=R_{1}^{2}+r^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{1}=\\frac{R^{2}-r^{2}}{2R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n又有"},{"type":"math","value":"evB=m\\frac{v^{2}}{R_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{Be(R^{2}-r^{2})}{2mR}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bd86e613c51b6bd23bc3e6411240ea2a3ad81550d365477529c3f98e0c9e7579.png","width":231,"height":160,"width_mm":29.2},{"type":"text","value":"可知，当"},{"type":"math","value":"v \\leq \\frac{Be(R^2 - r^2)}{2mR}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，所有电子都无法打到极板上，电流强度为0；当"},{"type":"math","value":"v > \\frac{Be(R^2 - r^2)}{2mR}"},{"type":"text","value":"时，发射方向沿OA的电子经偏转后刚到打到极板右下端C点，如图所示"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/33763a81b8cd6a4b1ffeab916872a02f369198e014aaed7d98f0e3aade82b309.png","width":221,"height":141,"width_mm":27.9},{"type":"text","value":"在三角形OAC中，由余弦定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"AC^{2}=r^{2}+R^{2}-2rR\\cos\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"，由正弦定理得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{R}{\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}+\\beta\\right)}=\\frac{AC}{\\sin\\alpha}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos\\beta=\\frac{R\\sin\\alpha}{AC}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n在三角形OAC中可得轨迹圆半径为"},{"type":"math","value":"r_{1}=\\frac{AC}{2\\cos\\beta}=\\frac{AC^{2}}{2R\\sin\\alpha}=\\frac{r^{2}+R^{2}-2rR\\cos\\alpha}{2R\\sin\\alpha}"},{"type":"text","value":"，因此"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{Be(r^{2}+R^{2}-2rR\\cos\\alpha)}{2Rm\\sin\\alpha}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n又因为电流强度为"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac{\\pi-\\alpha}{\\pi}Ne"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha=\\pi-\\frac{\\pi I}{Ne}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分），因此"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{Be\\left[r^{2}+R^{2}-2rR\\cos\\left(\\pi-\\frac{\\pi I}{Ne}\\right)\\right]}{2Rm\\sin\\left(\\pi-\\frac{\\pi I}{Ne}\\right)}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n注：画图正确的酌情给 1 分，但总分不超过该小题最大得分"}]}}]}
